1
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:21,630
What on earth!

2
00:00:24,510 --> 00:00:25,840
Look at that!

3
00:00:53,300 --> 00:00:54,000
It's closing in!

4
00:00:54,370 --> 00:00:55,880
Isn't there anyone available?

5
00:00:56,280 --> 00:00:59,670
We have word that Lightning Max
and Smile Man are on their way.

6
00:01:00,100 --> 00:01:01,960
Get me the threat level assessment!

7
00:01:08,210 --> 00:01:10,820
As you can see, loud explosions
are going off behind me!

8
00:01:10,820 --> 00:01:14,060
The damage left by the monster
is at an unprecedented scale.

9
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,590
Huge explosions
in City A

10
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,590
City A sustains heavy destruction due to heavy explosions c

11
00:01:14,060 --> 00:01:17,190
The Heroes Association is currently
analyzing the threat level—

12
00:01:22,220 --> 00:01:22,900
Time to go.

13
00:01:36,190 --> 00:01:38,670
JUSTICE

14
00:01:36,660 --> 00:01:38,670
ENFORCEMENT

15
00:01:42,540 --> 00:01:44,860
Daddy! Mommy!

16
00:02:02,720 --> 00:02:05,020
And who you might be?

17
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,910
Just a guy who's a hero for fun.

18
00:02:12,550 --> 00:02:13,630
What kind of...

19
00:02:14,120 --> 00:02:16,790
...half-assed backstory is that?

20
00:02:17,230 --> 00:02:18,950
I was formed from
the constant stream of pollution

21
00:02:18,950 --> 00:02:21,750
with which you humans
have suffused the earth.

22
00:02:21,830 --> 00:02:23,580
I am Vaccine Man!

23
00:02:24,290 --> 00:02:26,980
The Earth is a single living organism.

24
00:02:27,170 --> 00:02:30,100
You humans are nothing but
a disease-causing bacteria

25
00:02:30,100 --> 00:02:32,480
eating away at her lifeforce.

26
00:02:32,720 --> 00:02:36,890
In order to obliterate humans
and their evil civilization,

27
00:02:36,890 --> 00:02:40,450
the Earth has given birth to me!

28
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,940
You say you do this for fun?

29
00:02:42,980 --> 00:02:44,590
For fun?

30
00:02:44,610 --> 00:02:46,950
How dare you confront me,
Mother Earth's apostle,

31
00:02:46,990 --> 00:02:48,980
for that inane reason?!

32
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:51,420
Yet, what more could be
expected from a hu—

33
00:03:02,870 --> 00:03:03,590
Not again...

34
00:03:03,960 --> 00:03:05,960
All it took was one punch!

35
00:03:06,490 --> 00:03:09,880
DAMN IT!

36
00:04:41,970 --> 00:04:45,680
THREE YEARS AGO

37
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:43,930
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

38
00:04:43,990 --> 00:04:44,290
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

39
00:04:44,330 --> 00:04:44,620
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

40
00:04:44,620 --> 00:04:44,900
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

41
00:04:44,950 --> 00:04:45,230
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

42
00:04:45,270 --> 00:04:45,520
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

43
00:04:45,580 --> 00:04:46,010
Fuu-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku-Ku!

44
00:04:46,070 --> 00:04:47,850
– A monster!
– Run!

45
00:04:51,130 --> 00:04:52,200
Huh?

46
00:04:52,330 --> 00:04:54,840
You sure you
don't want to run away?

47
00:05:00,860 --> 00:05:04,090
I bet you're a newly employed
businessman already tired of work.

48
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:07,750
I ate too much crab and
transformed into this, Crablante!

49
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:11,080
Why aren't you running?

50
00:05:12,950 --> 00:05:14,850
You've got a death wish.

51
00:05:15,210 --> 00:05:16,460
Isn't that right?

52
00:05:16,890 --> 00:05:18,470
Well, not quite.

53
00:05:20,180 --> 00:05:22,470
I'm no businessman. I'm unemployed.

54
00:05:23,020 --> 00:05:25,180
Right now, I'm looking for a job.

55
00:05:26,320 --> 00:05:29,460
I had another interview today
and got rejected royally.

56
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:32,440
I couldn't care less about anything.

57
00:05:33,640 --> 00:05:36,040
So I'm in no mood to run

58
00:05:36,630 --> 00:05:38,250
just because the mighty
Crablante has appeared.

59
00:05:41,510 --> 00:05:44,070
So, what'll happen if I don't run?

60
00:05:46,990 --> 00:05:49,780
Your eyes are lifeless, just like mine.

61
00:05:49,780 --> 00:05:54,040
From one set of lifeless eyes
to another, I'll let you go.

62
00:05:54,330 --> 00:05:55,720
Besides, right now...

63
00:05:56,100 --> 00:05:58,940
I'm hunting different prey.

64
00:05:59,920 --> 00:06:01,810
A big-chinned brat.

65
00:06:02,150 --> 00:06:04,790
And when I find him,
I'm gonna rip his arms off!

66
00:06:19,430 --> 00:06:20,530
What're you looking at?

67
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:22,620
A big-chinned brat...

68
00:06:23,050 --> 00:06:24,540
If he's caught, he'll definitely be killed!

69
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:29,080
Hey, kid. Did you do anything
to a big crab monster earlier?

70
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:29,790
Huh?

71
00:06:31,110 --> 00:06:32,730
He was asleep in the park,

72
00:06:32,860 --> 00:06:34,390
so I drew some nipples on him.

73
00:06:35,630 --> 00:06:36,890
It's definitely him...

74
00:06:37,590 --> 00:06:40,620
He has no idea what he's done.

75
00:06:40,790 --> 00:06:43,260
What do I do? I could still help...

76
00:06:44,300 --> 00:06:46,400
But man, this kid isn't cute at all.

77
00:06:47,050 --> 00:06:48,470
It's none of my business...

78
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,520
I should just walk away.

79
00:06:51,840 --> 00:06:54,990
Right. I mean, who really cares anyway?

80
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:00,330
I found you!

81
00:07:02,540 --> 00:07:04,090
What the hell am I doing?

82
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:06,100
Huh!

83
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:10,100
Kid, he's after you!
Hurry, get outta here!

84
00:07:12,430 --> 00:07:14,830
Don't worry about me. Just go!

85
00:07:15,640 --> 00:07:17,360
B-But...

86
00:07:18,210 --> 00:07:19,400
My soccer ball...

87
00:07:19,450 --> 00:07:20,550
Your ball?!

88
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:25,770
Hey you, what's the big idea?

89
00:07:25,880 --> 00:07:29,270
Don't tell me you're gonna
protect that stinkin' brat!

90
00:07:29,270 --> 00:07:33,220
Come on, you're gonna kill him
over some harmless prank?

91
00:07:33,860 --> 00:07:35,480
Think about this!

92
00:07:36,530 --> 00:07:39,000
I've already mutilated lots of people.

93
00:07:39,130 --> 00:07:43,270
Whoever makes fun of
the way I look, pays the price.

94
00:07:45,040 --> 00:07:47,020
By the way, that brat...

95
00:07:47,570 --> 00:07:50,640
...drew nipples on my body.

96
00:07:50,640 --> 00:07:52,220
With a permanent marker!

97
00:07:52,660 --> 00:07:55,660
Look at these claws!
I can't even use a towel to wipe it off!

98
00:07:56,760 --> 00:08:01,560
If you get in my way, I'll make sure
you never go job hunting again!

99
00:08:12,940 --> 00:08:14,670
It just came to me.

100
00:08:14,730 --> 00:08:18,040
You look exactly like a villain
from this anime I used to watch!

101
00:08:27,050 --> 00:08:27,980
Die.

102
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:34,790
Hold it right there.

103
00:08:35,370 --> 00:08:38,750
In this age of declining birth rates,
I can't just let you kill a kid.

104
00:08:41,370 --> 00:08:42,340
You know what?

105
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,220
I've wanted to become a hero
ever since I was a little kid.

106
00:08:46,520 --> 00:08:48,240
Not a businessman,

107
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:51,000
but a hero, who could kick
asses of villains like you.

108
00:08:53,200 --> 00:08:54,930
Screw looking for a job!

109
00:08:55,900 --> 00:08:57,540
Bring it on!

110
00:08:57,920 --> 00:09:02,070
Some hero you are!

111
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:04,370
You're pathetic!

112
00:09:05,110 --> 00:09:07,420
You don't stand
a chance against me.

113
00:09:09,060 --> 00:09:12,280
Your life ends...now!

114
00:09:36,850 --> 00:09:39,450
Has it really been three years since then?

115
00:09:44,370 --> 00:09:48,950
After that day,
I trained so hard that I went bald.

116
00:09:49,110 --> 00:09:51,110
I became so powerful,
no one can beat me.

117
00:09:51,790 --> 00:09:54,480
I'm the hero I dreamed of becoming.

118
00:09:55,280 --> 00:09:58,300
So what is this? What's wrong?

119
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,700
Why does my heart feel so empty?

120
00:10:03,670 --> 00:10:05,590
482 yen, please.

121
00:10:06,170 --> 00:10:06,550
Okay.

122
00:10:08,650 --> 00:10:09,680
Oh, hang on.

123
00:10:16,320 --> 00:10:17,750
I have 82 yen.

124
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:43,690
Incredible...

125
00:10:43,980 --> 00:10:45,920
This is incredible, little brother!

126
00:10:47,390 --> 00:10:49,460
I never thought it would work so well.

127
00:10:51,690 --> 00:10:55,830
Yes, it's more than
I had ever imagined, big brother.

128
00:10:57,630 --> 00:11:00,850
My goal was to become
the strongest man in the world.

129
00:11:02,590 --> 00:11:03,810
The strongest man.

130
00:11:04,660 --> 00:11:06,090
That was my dream.

131
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:13,080
At last, the ultimate steroid,
"Biceps King," is complete!

132
00:11:15,020 --> 00:11:16,370
Little brother!

133
00:11:16,490 --> 00:11:19,410
Drink this and you will obtain
the power you've been seeking!

134
00:11:20,640 --> 00:11:23,130
Huh? Drink that?

135
00:11:23,490 --> 00:11:27,600
Indeed! I added strawberry flavoring,
to make it go down easier.

136
00:11:28,330 --> 00:11:29,220
Brother...

137
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:38,310
Yes, this will do!

138
00:11:39,830 --> 00:11:42,070
My brains and your brawn!

139
00:11:42,070 --> 00:11:45,560
By combining the greatest of minds
and the strongest of bodies,

140
00:11:45,600 --> 00:11:50,040
we brothers will conquer everything
on earth

141
00:11:50,090 --> 00:11:51,620
and rule as kings!

142
00:11:58,720 --> 00:12:00,680
I-Incredible!

143
00:12:01,120 --> 00:12:03,960
Well done, little brother.
Thousands have perished!

144
00:12:04,580 --> 00:12:07,820
Now, on to the next town
to destroy it as well!

145
00:12:09,580 --> 00:12:11,270
This! This is it, big bro.

146
00:12:11,440 --> 00:12:13,510
This is what I was looking for...

147
00:12:13,660 --> 00:12:15,530
To be the strongest man.

148
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:19,290
This is an emergency
evacuation warning.

149
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:23,950
A giant creature has
appeared in City D.

150
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:28,240
The creature is currently
heading towards City B.

151
00:12:28,710 --> 00:12:32,810
All residents of the area,
please evacuate immediately.

152
00:12:32,990 --> 00:12:36,040
I repeat, the giant creature
is currently heading for—

153
00:12:36,990 --> 00:12:39,600
Yes, that's right! Scatter like rats!

154
00:12:39,600 --> 00:12:40,870
Get them!

155
00:12:41,640 --> 00:12:43,170
I'm the strongest man,

156
00:12:43,460 --> 00:12:46,720
I'm the strongest.
I'm the strongest man.

157
00:12:46,860 --> 00:12:49,160
What do you think, brother?

158
00:12:49,210 --> 00:12:51,300
Yeah, how's it feel
being the strongest?

159
00:12:51,530 --> 00:12:52,390
What?!

160
00:12:52,390 --> 00:12:53,760
There's someone on your shoulder!

161
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,020
Put some pants on.

162
00:12:57,630 --> 00:13:00,060
That guy on your shoulder! Kill him!

163
00:13:09,460 --> 00:13:13,100
Brotherrrr!

164
00:13:13,490 --> 00:13:15,610
How did this happen?!

165
00:13:15,860 --> 00:13:19,260
I just wanted to be strong!

166
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:22,890
And I finally am
the strongest man, but...!

167
00:13:26,880 --> 00:13:31,680
I don't know who you are,
but it's your fault my brother is dead!

168
00:13:41,540 --> 00:13:42,990
The strongest!

169
00:13:43,240 --> 00:13:46,920
Behold our brotherly power!

170
00:14:01,020 --> 00:14:02,890
I am the strongest.

171
00:14:11,480 --> 00:14:13,250
So what if I am?

172
00:14:14,690 --> 00:14:15,560
I feel empty.

173
00:14:16,620 --> 00:14:17,490
Right?

174
00:14:28,030 --> 00:14:30,280
Having overwhelming strength is...

175
00:14:30,870 --> 00:14:32,520
...pretty boring.

176
00:14:35,510 --> 00:14:36,070
Oops.

177
00:14:36,800 --> 00:14:39,700
CITY B DESTROYED

178
00:14:56,150 --> 00:14:59,100
There's no sign that the evils
of the world are disappearing.

179
00:14:59,750 --> 00:15:03,130
This hasn't changed since
before I became a hero.

180
00:15:03,640 --> 00:15:07,490
In other words, you could say that
I haven't made any impact.

181
00:15:08,250 --> 00:15:10,820
I'm not necessarily sad about that.

182
00:15:12,370 --> 00:15:15,360
But there's something
bothering me lately.

183
00:15:16,470 --> 00:15:18,670
As the days pass,
my emotions grow more distant.

184
00:15:20,130 --> 00:15:24,610
Fear, tension, joy, anger...
I feel none of them anymore.

185
00:15:25,280 --> 00:15:26,790
In exchange for power,

186
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:30,050
maybe I've lost something
that's essential for a human being!

187
00:15:35,600 --> 00:15:37,090
Vroom, vroom?

188
00:15:38,580 --> 00:15:40,950
No sense hiding if you saw me.

189
00:15:41,170 --> 00:15:44,730
I'm Super Custom YO649Z Mk. II!

190
00:15:45,160 --> 00:15:46,390
I love...

191
00:15:46,430 --> 00:15:48,750
– building custom cars so much...

192
00:15:46,430 --> 00:15:48,750
– I used to feel all kinds of emotions

193
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:50,540
– I decked myself out.

194
00:15:48,750 --> 00:15:50,540
– whirling inside me when I fought.

195
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:53,680
– I'm a custom car-loving monster!

196
00:15:50,760 --> 00:15:53,680
– Fear. Panic. Anger.

197
00:15:54,060 --> 00:15:55,960
If you're thinking of getting in my way,

198
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:59,940
I'll put a shine on
that big headlight of yours!

199
00:16:05,130 --> 00:16:06,060
But now...

200
00:16:06,410 --> 00:16:08,300
all I need is one punch to end it.

201
00:16:11,910 --> 00:16:13,970
Guess I'll have eggs over rice tonight.

202
00:16:19,160 --> 00:16:21,220
Each day...

203
00:16:21,550 --> 00:16:23,220
I come home uninjured
and wash my gloves.

204
00:16:24,140 --> 00:16:26,770
When I'm out fighting monsters...

205
00:16:26,900 --> 00:16:29,640
I never feel as if my heart's really in it.

206
00:16:30,970 --> 00:16:34,500
I mean, I just do the
hero-thing as a hobby.

207
00:16:35,280 --> 00:16:36,150
In other words,

208
00:16:36,810 --> 00:16:38,440
as long as I get a kick out of it,

209
00:16:39,100 --> 00:16:40,380
that's all I care about.

210
00:17:02,430 --> 00:17:03,510
My house?!

211
00:17:17,970 --> 00:17:19,070
He's tough!

212
00:17:20,490 --> 00:17:22,120
What the hell are you?

213
00:17:22,910 --> 00:17:27,640
"What" am I? That's rude.
We are the true earthlings.

214
00:17:27,930 --> 00:17:28,900
We?

215
00:17:29,390 --> 00:17:32,990
I believe you call us
"Subterraneans."

216
00:17:34,020 --> 00:17:36,030
We suffer from overpopulation.

217
00:17:36,670 --> 00:17:39,760
Therefore, we must now
claim the world above ground.

218
00:17:40,900 --> 00:17:43,780
I understand that there are
many people on the surface too.

219
00:17:44,060 --> 00:17:46,340
As it stands, you are in our way.

220
00:17:47,120 --> 00:17:51,850
That is why we have decided
to eradicate you all.

221
00:17:53,040 --> 00:17:55,530
Since our invasion commenced,

222
00:17:55,550 --> 00:17:58,780
70% of the surface dwellers
have been killed.

223
00:17:59,180 --> 00:18:00,830
This is a battle for survival.

224
00:18:01,120 --> 00:18:03,880
I hope you can understand that.

225
00:18:04,920 --> 00:18:07,530
However, this is unexpected.

226
00:18:07,660 --> 00:18:09,410
We have encountered
no surface dwellers

227
00:18:09,410 --> 00:18:10,620
whom our punches would not kill.

228
00:18:10,770 --> 00:18:12,830
I'd like to state the same.

229
00:18:13,150 --> 00:18:16,730
It's been too long since
I've come across such worthy opponents,

230
00:18:16,820 --> 00:18:18,060
Subterraneans!

231
00:18:20,070 --> 00:18:22,050
We are earthlings!

232
00:18:30,530 --> 00:18:32,060
But how?!

233
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:34,080
You bastard!

234
00:18:38,290 --> 00:18:39,620
Die!

235
00:19:31,560 --> 00:19:32,940
It's over.

236
00:19:34,300 --> 00:19:37,920
What was that surface dweller?

237
00:19:38,080 --> 00:19:39,220
I'm...

238
00:19:39,990 --> 00:19:42,810
just a guy who's a hero for fun.

239
00:19:43,780 --> 00:19:45,490
I cannot lose!

240
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:47,790
And the surface...

241
00:19:48,570 --> 00:19:50,110
is under my protection!

242
00:19:52,010 --> 00:19:54,770
Big talk for a race of vermin!

243
00:20:09,220 --> 00:20:11,970
What is this feeling?

244
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:15,140
This wild throbbing in my heart?!

245
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:19,470
This rush,

246
00:20:20,040 --> 00:20:21,660
this tension!

247
00:20:28,410 --> 00:20:30,240
It's been so long, I forgot...

248
00:20:31,970 --> 00:20:32,770
...the...

249
00:20:33,800 --> 00:20:35,970
...exhilaration of a real fight!

250
00:20:50,050 --> 00:20:50,980
I see.

251
00:20:51,530 --> 00:20:52,980
It's coming back to me.

252
00:20:53,580 --> 00:20:54,470
This is it.

253
00:20:54,570 --> 00:20:55,980
Well, well...

254
00:20:56,770 --> 00:21:01,630
Looks like you've been taking
good care of my children.

255
00:21:02,010 --> 00:21:03,080
This is it!

256
00:21:03,630 --> 00:21:07,260
I, the Subterranean King,
will take you on.

257
00:21:08,570 --> 00:21:09,860
This is the very feeling...

258
00:21:11,280 --> 00:21:13,050
...I've been looking for!

259
00:21:29,660 --> 00:21:31,280
The surface is ours!

260
00:21:31,690 --> 00:21:33,920
You surface dwellers must die!

261
00:21:34,240 --> 00:21:36,000
I am the Subterranean King!

262
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,830
Surface dwellers,
prepare yourselves for—

263
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:47,420
All right, bring it on!

264
00:21:48,250 --> 00:21:49,290
Sorry about that

265
00:21:49,290 --> 00:21:52,010
Sorry about that

